<title>SINGAPORE: Freight Links nine months net S$3.67 mln.</title>
<headline>Freight Links nine months net S$3.67 mln.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine months ended Jan 31 1997</p>
<p>(in millions of Singapore dollars unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit	     3.67   vs   4.36 *</p>
<p>    Group share (cents)  2.39   vs   5.01</p>
<p>    Turnover	     137.82   vs  80.42</p>
<p>    Interest expense     2.22   vs   1.10</p>
<p>    Exceptionals	   1.06   vs    nil</p>
<p>    Pretax		   5.53   vs   5.79</p>
<p>    Tax			1.87   vs   1.42</p>
<p>* Comparative figures refer to previous 12 mths ended April 96 Note - Freight Links Express Holdings Ltd said turnover rose due to acquisitions made to broaden its earnings base and the group expects to maintain its present profit level for the current year.</p>
<p>-- Singapore Newsroom (65 8703080)</p>
</text>
